+<description>Improved:&lt;br&gt;• Opening profiles, coloured profile cards and long formatted posts no longer briefly adds about 85 MB of graphics memory&lt;br&gt;• Resizing the window with a chat open is smoother: the chat wallpaper no longer redraws its gradient on every step&lt;br&gt;</description>
